{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19084","headline":"送唐舍人出镇闽中 · 刘禹锡","name":"送唐舍人出镇闽中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暂辞鸳鹭出蓬瀛，忽拥貔貅镇粤城。\n闽岭夏云迎皂盖，建溪秋树映红旌。\n山川远地由来好，富贵当年别有情。\n了却人间婚嫁事，复归朝右作公卿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19084.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19084","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}